# React

## Prefer

- Functional components with explicit `JSX.Element` return type
- State via `useState`; side effects via `useEffect` with cleanup when needed
- Domain orchestration in hooks (e.g. `useRates`), not in presentational markup
- `fetch` for HTTP
- Cancel / ignore stale updates with a `cancelled` flag (or `AbortController`) in effects

## Avoid unless already used or clearly needed

- `useMemo` / `useCallback` by default
- Class components
- Global state libraries for this MVP
- Heavy UI kits
